### Public Endpoints

# 1. Get Public Settings
GET http://localhost:3000/api/settings/public

###

# 2. Get Active Combos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/combos

###

# 3. Get Cart Quote
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cart/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "comboId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "couponCode": "FRESH100",
  "deliveryZone": "inside_dhaka"
}

###

# 4. Create Order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_name": "Rahim Uddin",
  "phone": "01711000000",
  "division": "Dhaka",
  "district": "Dhaka",
  "area": "Mirpur",
  "address": "House 10, Road 2",
  "delivery_zone": "inside_dhaka",
  "payment_method": "cod",
  "items": [
    { "comboId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

###

# 5. Get Order by Public Token (Replace TOKEN with public_token from previous response)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/public/TOKEN

### Admin Endpoints

# 1. Admin Login
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

###

# 2. Get Dashboard Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/dashboard

###

# 3. Get All Combos (Includes Inactive)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/combos

###

# 4. Get Admin Orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/orders
